Good semantic instinct — `article` is for self-contained content. A clause card needs its section for context. Kept the `h4` for the clause heading, `p` for explanation.

Back to the restate: this component renders `section_number`, `clause_type`, and `explanation` — intentionally leaving out `purpose`, `market_standard`, and `fairness` (out of scope for M2 per spec). Same pattern as ScoreBadge — stateless, presentational, data via props.

